---
// About CamlockPro — 工厂直供 B2B 口径
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/ui/PageHero.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About CamlockPro — Cam and Groove Coupling Supplier"
  description="CamlockPro is a factory-direct supplier of aluminum, stainless steel, brass and polypropylene camlock couplings and fittings for demanding transfer duties."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Who we are"
    subtitle="CamlockPro is a factory-direct supplier of aluminum, stainless steel, brass and polypropylene camlock couplings for hygienic and demanding transfer duties."
    breadcrumb={{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Who we are' }}
  />
  <section class="cp-section">
    <div class="kv-container">
      <article class="cp-prose">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>CamlockPro supplies cam and groove couplings — types A through F, DC and DP — in aluminum, stainless steel, brass and polypropylene. We focus on the parts of the spec that decide whether a line works: the type letter, the size, the thread standard and the gasket compound.</p>
        <p>For a specific duty — fluid, pressure, temperature, hose or pipe size — send us the operating conditions and we will come back with coupling options, compatibility notes and figures.</p>
        <h2>What we supply</h2>
        <p>Eight ranges, each specified against real duties: aluminum couplings (types A-F, DC, DP, 1/2&quot;-6&quot;), stainless steel 304/316, brass, polypropylene, threaded fittings and adapters, gaskets and seals (EPDM, NBR, Viton, PTFE), dust caps and plugs, and replacement parts. All profiles built to A-A-59326D (MIL-C-27487) and EN 14420-7, interchangeable with Dixon, Banjo and PT style couplings.</p>
        <h2>Next step</h2>
        <p>Send your duty conditions, or browse the coupling ranges and selection guides first.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="cp-cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="kv-btn kv-btn--primary kv-btn--lg kv-btn--block-mobile">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="/products/" class="kv-btn kv-btn--outline kv-btn--lg kv-btn--block-mobile">Browse Coupling Ranges</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cp-section { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .cp-prose { max-width: 52rem; }
  .cp-prose h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .cp-prose h3 { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .cp-prose p { color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .cp-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.875rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
